--------------------------------------------------------------------------------
Segment #1   [00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:01,180] | Elapsed:  14.52s | Words: 5  | Text: 我现在很迷茫
Segment #2   [00:00:01,180 --> 00:00:02,340] | Elapsed:  14.52s | Words: 7  | Text: 在家待了一个月了
Segment #3   [00:00:02,340 --> 00:00:03,200] | Elapsed:  14.52s | Words: 5  | Text: 我应该怎么办
Segment #4   [00:00:03,640 --> 00:00:04,320] | Elapsed:  14.52s | Words: 2  | Text: 走出去
Segment #5   [00:00:04,320 --> 00:00:05,860] | Elapsed:  14.52s | Words: 7  | Text: 不要在家里躺着了
Segment #6   [00:00:06,300 --> 00:00:08,600] | Elapsed:  14.52s | Words: 6  | Text: 如果你们现在很迷茫
Segment #7   [00:00:08,600 --> 00:00:09,300] | Elapsed:  14.52s | Words: 3  | Text: 没有方向
Segment #8   [00:00:09,300 --> 00:00:10,140] | Elapsed:  14.52s | Words: 3  | Text: 没有心气
Segment #9   [00:00:10,140 --> 00:00:10,920] | Elapsed:  14.52s | Words: 3  | Text: 没有心力
Segment #10  [00:00:10,920 --> 00:00:12,900] | Elapsed:  14.53s | Words: 11 | Text: 我告诉你一个很简单的小伴们
Segment #11  [00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:13,900] | Elapsed:  14.53s | Words: 5  | Text: 你一定要听着做
Segment #12  [00:00:13,900 --> 00:00:15,920] | Elapsed:  14.53s | Words: 6  | Text: 你现在去你们城市
Segment #13  [00:00:15,920 --> 00:00:16,880] | Elapsed:  14.53s | Words: 3  | Text: 最贵的
Segment #14  [00:00:16,880 --> 00:00:17,760] | Elapsed:  14.53s | Words: 5  | Text: 小子楼也好
Segment #15  [00:00:17,760 --> 00:00:18,800] | Elapsed:  14.53s | Words: 7  | Text: 五星级酒店也好
Segment #16  [00:00:18,800 --> 00:00:19,960] | Elapsed:  14.53s | Words: 6  | Text: 去点一杯咖啡
Segment #17  [00:00:19,960 --> 00:00:22,300] | Elapsed:  14.53s | Words: 10 | Text: 而且一定要点一杯最贵的咖啡
Segment #18  [00:00:22,300 --> 00:00:23,000] | Elapsed:  14.53s | Words: 4  | Text: 然后就去喝
Segment #19  [00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:24,120] | Elapsed:  14.53s | Words: 8  | Text: 把这杯咖啡给喝掉
Segment #20  [00:00:24,880 --> 00:00:25,620] | Elapsed:  14.53s | Words: 4  | Text: 喝完之后
Segment #21  [00:00:25,620 --> 00:00:26,680] | Elapsed:  14.53s | Words: 8  | Text: 你就整体就不一样了
Segment #22  [00:00:26,680 --> 00:00:27,840] | Elapsed:  14.53s | Words: 4  | Text: 不要问我原因
Segment #23  [00:00:27,840 --> 00:00:28,720] | Elapsed:  14.53s | Words: 4  | Text: 不要问我为什么
Segment #24  [00:00:29,260 --> 00:00:30,180] | Elapsed:  27.53s | Words: 4  | Text: 不要讲逻辑
Segment #25  [00:00:30,180 --> 00:00:31,460] | Elapsed:  27.53s | Words: 7  | Text: 你就听话照做就行了
Segment #26  [00:00:31,460 --> 00:00:32,700] | Elapsed:  27.53s | Words: 3  | Text: 首先第一步
Segment #27  [00:00:32,700 --> 00:00:33,560] | Elapsed:  27.53s | Words: 4  | Text: 你得走出来
Segment #28  [00:00:33,560 --> 00:00:35,020] | Elapsed:  27.53s | Words: 8  | Text: 你不能从家里腿坠了
Segment #29  [00:00:35,620 --> 00:00:36,980] | Elapsed:  27.53s | Words: 6  | Text: 你得知论起来
Segment #30  [00:00:36,980 --> 00:00:38,800] | Elapsed:  27.53s | Words: 6  | Text: 你得感受这个生活
Segment #31  [00:00:39,960 --> 00:00:41,720] | Elapsed:  27.53s | Words: 7  | Text: 你要去有磁场的地方
Segment #32  [00:00:41,720 --> 00:00:42,880] | Elapsed:  27.53s | Words: 5  | Text: 迷茫很简单
Segment #33  [00:00:42,880 --> 00:00:43,380] | Elapsed:  27.53s | Words: 3  | Text: 我告诉你
Segment #34  [00:00:43,380 --> 00:00:45,660] | Elapsed:  27.53s | Words: 9  | Text: 所有的事情它都有表准谈案
Segment #35  [00:00:45,660 --> 00:00:46,160] | Elapsed:  27.53s | Words: 4  | Text: 只不过说
Segment #36  [00:00:46,160 --> 00:00:47,080] | Elapsed:  27.53s | Words: 5  | Text: 你不愿意听
Segment #37  [00:00:47,080 --> 00:00:47,920] | Elapsed:  27.53s | Words: 5  | Text: 你不愿意做
Segment #38  [00:00:47,920 --> 00:00:49,000] | Elapsed:  27.53s | Words: 3  | Text: 想破局
Segment #39  [00:00:49,760 --> 00:00:50,520] | Elapsed:  27.53s | Words: 2  | Text: 第一步
Segment #40  [00:00:50,520 --> 00:00:51,580] | Elapsed:  27.53s | Words: 5  | Text: 是你要先破圈
